    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d720">

                <pb facs="0766" n="752" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg752"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.6363/10–344: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Chile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-10-12T20:00:00-04:00">October 12, 1944—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1080. Reurtel no. 1519 of Sept. 20 and no. 1580, Oct, 3.<anchor n="73"
                        xml:id="d720-f1"/> As result of consideration by the Essential Requirements
                        Committee,<anchor n="74" xml:id="d720-f2"/> the following total quantities
                    for Chile covering the 12 months’ period beginning October 1 are approved as
                    follows in barrels:<anchor n="75" xml:id="d720-f3"/>
                    <table cols="2" rend="width: 50%" rendition="#center" rows="5">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell>Gasoline</cell>
                            <cell role="num">627,138</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Kerosene</cell>
                            <cell role="num">102,199</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Light Diesel oil</cell>
                            <cell role="num">150,000</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Heavy Diesel oil</cell>
                            <cell role="num">195,350</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Fuel oil</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5,720,756</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table>
                </p>
                <p>Due to mounting war demands for gasoline in the Pacific, the supply situation
                    will not permit any greater supply of gasoline for Chile at this time.</p>
                <p>The Embassy should submit detailed schedules supporting the above total
                    quantities as soon as possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d720-f1" n="73" xml:id="d720-f1-content">
                <p>Neither printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d720-f2" n="74" xml:id="d720-f2-content">
                <p>Presumably the Requirements Committee of the War Production Board.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d720-f3" n="75" xml:id="d720-f3-content">
                <p>These figures represent an increase of 33,838 barrels of gasoline and 22,499
                    barrels of kerosene.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
